---
import Card from '../ui/Card.astro';
const beliefs=[['Problem before technology.','Start with what needs solving—not what technology happens to be fashionable.'],['Depth before assumptions.','The better we understand a problem, the better we can understand what deserves to be built.'],['Build to learn.','Ideas become useful when they meet reality.'],['Outcomes over outputs.','What changes matters more than what we produce.'],['Stay curious.',"The next important problem may come from somewhere we didn't expect."]];
---
<div class="co">
<section class="co-section co-hero"><div class="co-wrap co-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">THE COMPANY</p><h1>Built to solve<br/><em>what matters.</em></h1><p>E Deviser is a problem-solving company built around a simple belief: important problems deserve the curiosity, depth, and determination to find better ways forward.</p></div><div class="co-studio" role="img" aria-label="A considered workspace representing people coming together to solve difficult problems"><div class="co-window"></div><div class="co-screen">E DEVİSER<i></i></div><span>A COMPANY BUILT AROUND THE WORK.</span></div></div></section>
<section class="co-section" id="why"><div class="co-wrap co-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">WHY E DEVİSER EXISTS</p><h2>Because some problems are <em>worth going deeper for.</em></h2></div><div class="co-copy"><p>We started E Deviser to build—not simply advise, observe, or wait for someone else to solve the difficult problems we care about.</p><p>We believe meaningful progress comes from getting close to the problem, understanding what makes it difficult, bringing the right people and capabilities together, and having the courage to build something new.</p></div></div><div class="co-wrap"><Card as="div" variant="light" class="co-statement"><small>OUR REASON TO BUILD</small><strong>Get close to the problem.<br/>Bring the right capabilities.<br/><em>Make progress real.</em></strong></Card></div></section>
<section class="co-section co-alt" id="beliefs"><div class="co-wrap"><p class="co-kicker">OUR BELIEFS</p><div class="co-grid"><h2>Principles that shape <em>the work.</em></h2><p class="co-copy">These are not slogans for the wall. They are the questions we return to when deciding what deserves our time, attention, and effort.</p></div><div class="co-beliefs">{beliefs.map((b,i)=><article><small>0{i+1}</small><div><h3>{b[0]}</h3><p>{b[1]}</p></div><b>↗</b></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="co-section" id="future"><div class="co-wrap co-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">LOOKING AHEAD</p><h2>Small enough to stay curious.<br/><em>Ambitious enough to matter.</em></h2></div><div class="co-copy"><p>E Deviser is still early. That's intentional.</p><p>We are building a company capable of going deep on difficult problems, developing new capabilities along the way, and carrying what we learn from one challenge into the next.</p><p>The company may evolve. The problems we work on may change. The technologies will certainly change.</p><strong>Our willingness to build will not.</strong></div></div></section>
<section class="co-section co-alt" id="today"><div class="co-wrap co-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">WHERE WE ARE NOW</p><h2>Going deep on <em>learning.</em></h2><p class="co-copy">Education is where we are currently applying our approach most deeply—because learning is consequential, complex, measurable, and capable of affecting millions of lives.</p><p class="co-copy">Cuevo is the first major expression of that commitment.</p><a href="/cuevo/">Explore Cuevo ↗</a></div><a class="co-cuevo" href="/cuevo/"><small>OUR FIRST MAJOR EXPRESSION</small><b>CUEVO</b><span>INTELLIGENCE FOR LEARNING</span><i>↗</i></a></div></section>
<section class="co-section co-close"><div class="co-wrap"><p class="co-kicker">STILL BUILDING</p><small>STILL BUILDING.</small><h2>The problems will change.<br/><em>The ambition won't.</em></h2><p>We are building E Deviser for the long term—one important problem, one real solution, and one lesson at a time.</p><a href="/company/careers-contact/">Talk to E Deviser →</a></div></section>
</div>
<style>
.co{--bg:var(--color-surface);--txt:var(--brand-navy);--muted:var(--color-text-muted);--line:var(--color-border);background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);overflow:hidden}.co *{box-sizing:border-box}.co-wrap{width:min(88rem,calc(100% - 3rem));margin:auto}.co-section{padding:clamp(var(--space-20),8.5vw,var(--space-32)) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.co-alt{background:var(--color-surface-soft)}.co-kicker{margin:0 0 var(--space-4);color:var(--text-on-light-link);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:var(--text-xs);font-weight:var(--weight-bold);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-wide);text-transform:uppercase}.co small{font:600 var(--text-micro) var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--text-on-light-link)}.co h1,.co h2{line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-6);color:var(--txt)}.co h1{font-size:var(--text-h1)}.co h2{font-size:var(--text-h2)}.co h1 em,.co h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--text-on-light-link)}@supports ((background-clip:text) or (-webkit-background-clip:text)){.co h1 em,.co h2 em{background-image:var(--gradient-brand-text);background-clip:text;-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;color:transparent}}.co p{line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}.co-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .85fr;gap:7vw;align-items:center}.co-hero{min-height:39rem;display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--gradient-pattern-light)}.co-hero h1{margin:var(--space-6) 0}.co-hero-grid>div:first-child>p:last-child,.co-copy{max-width:40rem;color:var(--muted);font-size: var(--text-base)}.co-studio{height:27rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--color-surface-night-hover),var(--color-surface-night-raised) 55%,var(--brand-ink))}.co-window{position:absolute;inset:0 0 0 38%;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 18%,color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-blue-light) 9.4%, transparent) 18.2% 18.5%),linear-gradient(110deg,transparent,color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-navy) 53.3%, transparent))}.co-screen{position:absolute;inset-inline-end:17%;top:25%;width:27%;height:30%;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;background:var(--color-surface-night-hover);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-teal) 46.7%, transparent);color:var(--brand-white);font:600 var(--text-micro) var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.15em;box-shadow:0 0 35px color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-blue) 13.3%, transparent)}.co-screen i{width:2rem;height:1px;background:var(--brand-teal);margin:var(--space-3) auto}.co-studio>span{position:absolute;bottom:1.5rem;inset-inline-start:1.5rem;font:500 var(--text-micro) var(--font-mono);color:var(--brand-teal-light);letter-spacing:.12em}.co-founder{margin-top:var(--space-12)}.co-mark{height:25rem;position:relative;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--line);background:radial-gradient(circle,color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-blue) 15.7%, transparent),transparent 55%)}.co-mark>b{font:800 var(--text-artwork-display) var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.1em}.co-mark>b span{color:var(--text-on-light-link)}.co-mark>small{margin-top:var(--space-4);color:var(--text-on-light-link)}.co-mark>i{position:absolute;inset:20%;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-teal) 55%, transparent);border-radius:50%;transform:rotate(-25deg) scaleY(.6)}.co-founder h2{font-size: var(--text-h2)}.co a{display:inline-block;margin-top:var(--space-4);color:var(--text-on-light-link);text-decoration:none;font-size: var(--text-sm);font-weight:650}.co small.co-note{display:block;margin-top:var(--space-6);color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size: var(--text-micro)}.co-statement{margin-top:var(--space-16);padding:var(--space-8);border:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:var(--space-8);background:var(--color-surface-raised);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}.co-statement strong{font-size: var(--text-h3);line-height:1.3}.co-statement em{font-style:normal;color:var(--text-on-light-link)}.co-beliefs{margin-top:var(--space-12);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.co-beliefs article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr 2rem;gap:var(--space-4);align-items:center;padding:var(--space-6) var(--space-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.co-beliefs article>small{align-self:start}.co-beliefs h3{font-size: var(--text-xl);margin:0 0 var(--space-2)}.co-beliefs p{font-size: var(--text-sm);color:var(--muted)}.co-beliefs article>b{color:var(--text-on-light-link);font-weight:400}.co-rule{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--space-4);margin-top:var(--space-16);color:var(--text-on-light-link);font:500 var(--text-micro) var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.1em}.co-rule i{height:1px;flex:1;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--brand-blue),var(--brand-teal))}.co-copy strong{color:var(--brand-navy)}.co-cuevo{min-height:19rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-teal) 46.7%, transparent);background:radial-gradient(circle,color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-blue) 20%, transparent),transparent 60%),var(--brand-ink)}.co-cuevo b{font:800 var(--text-display) var(--font-display);letter-spacing:.12em;margin:var(--space-4) 0;color:white}.co-cuevo span{font:500 var(--text-micro) var(--font-mono);color:var(--brand-teal-light);letter-spacing:.12em}.co-cuevo i{position:absolute;inset-inline-end:1.5rem;bottom:1.5rem;color:var(--brand-teal);font-style:normal}.co-close{background:var(--gradient-pattern-light)}.co-close>div>small{display:block;margin-top:var(--space-8)}.co-close h2{margin:var(--space-6) 0}.co-close>div>p:not(.co-kicker){max-width:42rem;color:var(--muted)}.co-close a{border:1px solid var(--text-on-light-link);border-radius:99px;padding:var(--space-3) var(--space-5)}
@media(max-width:800px){.co-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--space-8)}.co-studio{height:22rem}.co-mark{height:19rem}.co-statement{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
@media(max-width:600px){.co-wrap{width:calc(100% - 2rem)}.co-section{padding:var(--space-18) 0}.co h1{font-size:var(--text-hero-mobile)}.co h2{font-size:var(--text-h2)}.co-studio{height:17rem}.co-mark{height:16rem}.co-mark>b{font-size: var(--text-display)}.co-beliefs article{grid-template-columns:2rem 1fr 1rem;padding:var(--space-5) 0}.co-beliefs h3{font-size: var(--text-lg)}.co-rule{gap:var(--space-2);font-size: var(--text-micro)}}

</style>